From 2c93ace9e4295892e542b6c06102ab37b0ad0c86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 04:55:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-151: eye colour and marking layers over the face
 (CharSections sections 5 and 6)

- VARIATION_EYES / VARIATION_MARKINGS composited after the face in CreateRequestHU/HL
- CycleCharCustomization / GetCharCustomizationInfo / SetCharCustomizationFilter index 6 and 7
- CMSG_CHAR_CREATE sends eye and marking; SMSG_CHAR_ENUM ZEPC trailer read into CHARACTER_INFO
- in-world players read them from UNIT_FIELD_PADDING (byte 0 eye, byte 1 marking)
- ~CharacterBaseVariation freed 7 texture slots of a 3-slot array

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01URnr7tKsFMZq4VFsSKkj3S
